# Pre-confirm verification

After C/C++ edits, run a host **syntax-only** compile. Do **not** run `pio run` or `pio check` after every edit.

Command: see `.agents/skills/pio-workflow/SKILL.md` → Host syntax-only check.

Full `pio run -e m5stack-core2` only when the user asks to build/flash, when Arduino/ESP-IDF APIs or `platformio.ini` change, or before a PR/flash.
